<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<!--
Nordic addition to the post-payment sponsor details form.

    The national identity number, asked between the phone number and the
    optional address, so the gift can be reported to the sponsor's tax
    authority and they get their deduction:

    - Sweden: personnummer, for Skatteverket's KU65.
    - Norway: fodselsnummer, for Skatteetaten's gaver til frivillige
      organisasjoner.
    - Denmark: CPR-nummer, for skatteindberetningsloven § 26.

    Optional, and stated as such. The reporting duty is what makes collecting
    a national identity number lawful in each of the three countries, and it
    is purpose-bound: a sponsor who does not want the deduction leaves the
    field empty and nothing stops them.

    Injected data (added to the base form's, see my_compassion):
    - details_prefill['social_sec_nr']: the number already on file, if any.
    - sponsorship ('recurring.contract'): whose company decides both whether
      this renders at all and which country's format is expected.
-->
<odoo>
  <template
    id="my2_new_sponsorship_details_ssn"
    inherit_id="my_compassion.my2_new_sponsorship_details_extra_fields"
    name="New Sponsorship Details - National Identity Number"
  >
    <xpath expr="." position="inside">
      <t t-if="sponsorship._my2_collects_ssn()">
        <t t-set="ssn_country" t-value="sponsorship._my2_ssn_country_code()" />
        <t t-call="theme_compassion_2025.FormFieldComponent">
          <t t-set="top_class" t-value="'my-3'" />
          <t t-set="label">
            <t t-if="ssn_country == 'SE'">Personnummer (optional)</t>
            <t t-elif="ssn_country == 'NO'">Fødselsnummer (optional)</t>
            <t t-elif="ssn_country == 'DK'">CPR-nummer (optional)</t>
            <t t-else="">National identity number (optional)</t>
          </t>
          <t t-set="input_id" t-value="'details_social_sec_nr'" />
          <input
            id="details_social_sec_nr"
            type="text"
            name="social_sec_nr"
            class="form-control"
            autocomplete="off"
            t-att-value="details_prefill.get('social_sec_nr')"
          />
          <div class="body-small text-low-black mt-1">
            <t
              t-if="ssn_country == 'SE'"
            >We only use this to report your gift to Skatteverket, so you get your tax deduction. Once we have it, the report is made automatically and cannot be declined.</t>
            <t
              t-elif="ssn_country == 'NO'"
            >We only use this to report your gift to Skatteetaten, so you get your tax deduction.</t>
            <t
              t-elif="ssn_country == 'DK'"
            >We only use this to report your gift to Skattestyrelsen, so you get your tax deduction. Tell us before the end of the year if you would rather we did not report it.</t>
            <t
              t-else=""
            >We only use this to report your gift to the tax authority, so you get your tax deduction.</t>
          </div>
        </t>
      </t>
    </xpath>
  </template>
</odoo>
